From: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] proxy: add Mihomo TUIC v4/v5 inbound and outbound

Use the pinned Mihomo v1.19.32 TUIC implementation and its QUIC/TLS stack.
Adapt authenticated streams and UDP associations to Xray routing. Support
v4 tokens and v5 UUID/password users, native datagrams and QUIC stream UDP,
congestion control, early handshakes, reusable clients and socket options.
Join packet copy loops before closing upstream packet state and preserve
Xray private-target restrictions on the TUIC inbound.

Mihomo is GPL-3.0-or-later; include its license with the adapter.
Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>

